"<p>Quick guide to the tabs on this page -- each shows Autotask ticket activity for a chosen day/week, for a fast daily check rather than a full report.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Asked for Review</b> -- pick a week to see which tickets had a Google review request sent, so you can follow up.</li>\n<li><b>Tickets Created</b> -- pick a date to see every ticket created that day, grouped by client.</li>\n<li><b>Completed Tickets</b> -- pick a date to see every ticket completed that day, grouped by technician.</li>\n<li><b>Ticket Times</b> -- pick a date to see every ticket with time logged that day, grouped by technician.</li>\n</ul>"